  "templates": {
    "T1_comment": "We love this! Could we share it on @examplecandleco with credit to you? Reply \"YES #examplecandleathome\" and we'll post it with your handle. We won't use it in ads without asking you again.",
    "T2_dm": "Hi {first name or handle}, it's the Example Candle team here. Your photo of {product} on {date} made our day. May we repost it on our Instagram and Facebook with \"Photo: @{handle}\"? Reply YES to agree, or tell us if you'd rather not. We won't use it in ads without asking you again, and you can ask us to take it down any time.",
    "T3_email": "Subject: How is your {product} burning?\nYour order should be glowing by now. Share a photo on Instagram with #examplecandleathome and tag @examplecandleco, or reply to this email with it. We ask before we repost anything, and we always credit you.",
    "T4_insert": "Card in the box: \"Light it, snap it, tag @examplecandleco #examplecandleathome. We'll ask before we share.\" with a QR code to the submission page.",
    "T5_story": "Story with a question sticker: \"Where does your candle live? Tag us in a photo.\" Check story mentions every day: they disappear after 24 hours.",
    "T6_ads_scope": "Thanks again for letting us repost your photo. Could we also use it in our paid ads on Instagram and Facebook for the next 6 months? It will show \"Photo: @{handle}\". Reply \"YES ADS\" to agree. No is completely fine, and the repost stays up either way."
  },
